OL,3,GNEWSA'We share what we do with love' -
OL,4,AMela festival celebrates 20th
OL,5,Aanniversary
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt's hard to think of Belfast Mela as
OL,8,Fanything other than a massive,
OL,9,Fmulti-day, cultural celebration of
OL,10,Fmusic, dance, arts and food.
OL,12,FBut as the festival found its feet in
OL,13,Fits early years, it was much smaller.
OL,14,FIt attracted 500 people and its founder
OL,15,Fthought it would only last a short
OL,16,Ftime.
OL,18,FFast forward to 2026, and it is
OL,19,Festablished as one of Northern
OL,20,FIreland's largest arts festivals,
OL,21,Fcelebrating cultural diversity.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
